e in the country. But the combination of a scandal-scarred GOP nominee in K=
en Paxton and a terrible midterm environment for Republicans has given Demo=
crat James Talarico a shot at a historic upset, if the tsunami of Republica=
n money ($193 million and counting) doesn=E2=80=99t overwhelm him.</p><p st=
yle=3D"margin-top:24px;font-size:16px">It=E2=80=99s a measure of just how d=
